msgid ""
"This article explains how to connect the *3DR Radio v1* to your flight "
"controller. You should also read :ref:`SiK Radio v2 <common-sik-telemetry-"
"radio>`, which contains a more detailed user guide and feature list."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何将 *3DR Radio v1* 连接至飞控。您还应阅读 :ref:`SiK Radio v2 <common-sik-telemetry-"
"radio>`，其中包含更详细的用户指南和功能列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:17
#: 211505c0f9e64e2f9026399c0201d6bd 223226bd013f463db0fcff15db36b280
#: 254bded046654c118d9376544161e787 6665e227f2ae4dea94f0693dbe0be961
#: f38c135958df4459a79c229b52a1fda9 f4c5ffd474034d21bd02795415b9ac7a
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:19
#: 419fb9184c1848aeb7eb1a928aaa20b2 5b52cf2e1a174fca9239bea05b8f38bf
#: 899a2103bc654037a44e33858cd3cec2 abcb8f899d4b402a90b8b1e411b6e8c3
#: c9332d5ffcd24b47bc11286453a4fe5c d72e3b415eac4be2b590011a59ea2bf4
msgid ""
"The *3DR Radio* is the easiest way to setup a telemetry connection between "
"your autopilot and a ground station."
msgstr "*3DR Radio* 是建立飞控与地面站数传连接的最简便方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:22
#: 100e82e2310d407184a70ad03976dee5 2a820d72c9844a0698e15ff55cb64242
#: 3b5b0d7428a04c0da5d336c0ef1c4437 41fc2c381b934f96b0c4ca545303a59a
#: 44e971e0e6a7492eb4cd98cd44c8b026 db2204530a4e47bda974168c32c43f25
msgid ""
"There are two versions of the 3DR Radio (version 2 is more recent, see link "
"above). The radios have slightly different form factors and connections (v2 "
"comes with a built-in FTDI cable) but otherwise their behaviour is very "
"similar."
msgstr ""
"3DR Radio 有两个版本（v2 是更新版本，见上方链接）。两个版本的外形和接口略有不同（v2 内置 FTDI 数据线），但功能基本相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:30
#: 2bb95e9a0a0f4b15ad3947b53435d142 3da145340a70455880183860802102f9
#: 99f4a0bf9af64013a542b1a4abce97d4 ccba341e772d478c98d2c0cb5e38e23c
#: f2ee213e0d9d4e7fb996e220d298b55e fa85e46bee7141e2a638a58bebf73e9c
msgid "."
msgstr "."

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:32
#: 3979ba4378c143bfaee7e999dd8c51a0 649e2f8b753b438cb657a7fb8d455201
#: 6866fb8c2dd9475486676589c9d69c68 8afaa462298b47aa897abbb4ff23096f
#: 91515ffea83b47c4aeb22f93e92753d9 f8c065c832d24d8a8ed33e2af08a14cc
msgid ""
"This article only covers the main difference between the two radios — "
"connecting the radios."
msgstr "本文仅介绍两种电台的主要区别——电台连接方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:36
#: 9090061b064f4fe181948d6188b95caf 976dedd346424b64ae2bde4f31b2777d
#: b1e9f2b0d7df4f098d7e28ed6fca927b b33b38d7135b43f180e6455356035118
#: bc03b153e00a4b2686d1d451eeef6a87 dd3321150e0a4c3c963e79a42f7f625a
msgid "Connecting the radio"
msgstr "连接电台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:38
#: 076b81a880004f3f8759a16d6ea2f2ba 122d8fd8dc7541d391d7e851dd3ad176
#: 26cfe460e6f14b58a60cbddf44903ed0 9f72dd1fcdcb48fd9a5f14d84f01a3f5
#: a5ca4de400e243eeb28e3b300d089fed cc33227564904f479096f8f34c8b2885
msgid "3DR Radio v1 has different radio modules for air and ground:"
msgstr "3DR Radio v1 空中和地面有不同的电台模块："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:40
#: 1acd3cb3996a4f7fa9b85aac7ebf2b5a 42b5aa45d5e34f9d82d6812576779281
#: 8b98cb8e027b4e95a3be5b6604a38084 ada550e75a5b46a0a4ddb4d96454d377
#: adbc7283ea58473788e83f3bd4fb3790 c99eb1ba36234c74bdef973daa4b7970
msgid ""
"The \"ground\" module has a USB connector making it easy to connect directly"
" to your ground station. On a windows 7 or higher machine, the require "
"drivers should be automatically installed the first time you plug in the "
"ground module but if it does not install for some reason or the ground "
"computer is running Windows XP (or earlier) you can get the D2XX FTDI driver"
" `here. <http://www.ftdichip.com/Drivers/D2XX.htm>`__"
msgstr ""
"「地面」模块带有 USB 连接器，可直接连接至地面站。在 Windows 7 "
"及以上系统中，首次插入地面模块时应自动安装所需驱动；若未自动安装或地面电脑运行 Windows XP（或更早），可从 `此处 "
"<http://www.ftdichip.com/Drivers/D2XX.htm>`__ 获取 D2XX FTDI 驱动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:47
#: 00d121a3082e410ebde1df9311dbfb59 1e83eeddb7664db7a0fb83b9fa101cd2
#: 53e44312a0284d72892075d6a606d768 a0b8a1f8f44f4b5fb6089d71e9007666
#: d377034277544477b4d96779b1a36d01 fd044c55a2a04ece946def95995519f4
msgid ""
"The 'aircraft' module has a FTDI six pin header, allowing it to be directly "
"connected to your Autopilot's telemetry port as shown in the following "
"sections."
msgstr "「机载」模块带有 FTDI 六针接头，可直接连接至飞控的数传接口，如以下各节所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:53
#: 07f8ca240fec40659735f8c07a4f4b03 1932204a7d2d4a26bc61e63ac0fc1f78
#: 35388ac24b134fcbad22870363583019 8cab5825b24944a6992e4e6e66427fde
#: b1c16b198ab8474284f6ac21d48ce16e e16760f531d84226b51394746cfc6d9e
msgid "Connecting to the AutoPilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:55
#: 0e6efd2478884f1fbcaa9bd9d36d3782 2ee4c46d64394f0db18c6c6b8e31327e
#: 6b683f2dea45403597b9d8d67cf4a8c6 ceb25df4482f452f884eec5351502720
#: e050dfd1933247e9b1f7d013f0d3bb4c eadf37f777f04eba95942946fc1d372a
msgid ""
"The aircraft module will be need to be connected to an autopilot's serial "
"port, sometimes marked as TELEM1 or TELEM2. The TX and RX pins of the radio "
"to the RX and TX signals of the Serial port. If the port has CTS and RTS "
"pins, then connecting them will provide flow control and increased "
"reliability at longer ranges. The ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` for the UART port to "
"which the module is connected should be set to \"2\" (MAVLink2).Be sure that"
" the radio is programmed with the latest firmware in order to work properly "
"with MAVLink2 protocol. See the section below for programming."
msgstr ""
"机载模块需连接至飞控的串口（有时标注为 TELEM1 或 TELEM2），电台的 TX 和 RX 引脚分别对应串口的 RX 和 TX 信号。若串口有 "
"CTS 和 RTS 引脚，连接它们可提供流量控制并在更远距离提高可靠性。与模块连接的 UART 端口 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 应设置为"
" '2'（MAVLink2）。请确保电台已刷入最新固件以正常使用 MAVLink2 协议，固件刷入说明见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:61
#: 1f542638d5a6400fa085901d283eeb50 2d3eca2bb5fa45da8147b0f3a6ca7004
#: 4818ab2ef9c2440da2b9ee60c9ee01b4 601542e45fda49c19eec58c7f128b8f1
#: 7b310d30ff864f15a7754449573579d9 f8d73854997d4a1ea997f8a95d1afd75
msgid "Changing Configuration of the Radio"
msgstr "更改电台配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:63
#: 174a4575ab1d42aea487fc7c59949f47 1c77dbd23f1e4b6888152bebe5bda86b
#: 32df3526215c45bba3efa2939e842ad5 76bf3aeee42d4e4caba09f22e2e38cce
#: 7975f156aa3143e9a74fe73b1c096050 d2d5f45e873341bfa93ba912907a56dd
msgid ""
"This is not usually required, but if desired see: :ref:`common-configuring-"
"a-telemetry-radio-using-mission-planner`"
msgstr ""
"通常不需要更改配置，若需要请参阅：:ref:`common-configuring-a-telemetry-radio-using-mission-"
"planner`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:68
#: 580c58b384934bcdaaced759698041f6 62bde4828479471bb1e2cacab37d0623
#: 8cafc1508039418985c08e1b6d7a79c5 ee105d3f47f34abb9719220d914adf1f
#: f4709e68b8524484ae0d6cad5094aed8 f8828b65db834b55b49bacd6a2e65bc9
msgid "Updating the Firmware"
msgstr "更新固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:70
#: 072558ebaed84e4a990440b13e162846 5550ea8f922147f69e43381d2da59a74
#: 675a36507a06421a9e60ab69810e271f 6e6f5333521a4874b05895f7d16f1fd4
#: 7cd113d4646045a6ba9c2c1e33113aa3 b8e68e17e2524ef38bf82f869ffa05b2
msgid ""
"Using Mission Planner, with the module connected to the autopilot for power "
"and the base USB unit plugged into the computer:"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner，将模块连接至飞控供电，并将基础 USB 装置插入电脑："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:72
#: 250a9885b3a44823b79d9c53f844b781
msgid ""
"determine the USB COMM port the base radio is using and enter that into the "
"port selection box of Mission Planner along with the baud rate (57600 is "
"defualt for the radios)."
msgstr ""
"确定基础电台使用的 USB COMM 端口，在 Mission Planner 的端口选择框中输入该端口及波特率（电台默认为 57600）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:73
#: 4acf95a24dfd44e68f7fb5c05fd12ebf 5285e8d8d6bb46c6b1c9cd8a4bf20bcf
#: 688aa50ba6624b4c94c2361e990e12ce aa8763c15c4141a895362c708f2f8c68
#: dd06c1960cf041c3b6ec9cbd5cc18370 e90536eecbde479cb84ce1bef59d8275
msgid ""
"WITHOUT connecting anything in Mission Planner, use the SETUP/Optional "
"Hardware/Sik Radio utility tab to \"Upload Firmware (local)\" which will "
"download the latest firmware and write it to the radios."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中 **不连接任何内容**，使用 SETUP/可选硬件/SiK Radio "
"实用程序标签中的「上传固件（本地）」功能下载最新固件并写入电台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:74
#: 1cd88da06f554d97a7dba0a9ab0d7f66 52ce33459a364cc69a811680be96679a
#: 68a542a148bd4221b3a73b1db14bb6e3 9edeb1ea54d84c55998b40b1e180abcb
#: c8f5f320407143089c86123fa92ac4e7 dae38d4b6e3f496ea23f3d9a170290f0
msgid ""
"You may now CONNECT to the base radio COMM port with Mission Planner over "
"MAVLink using the radio links."
msgstr "现在可以通过 Mission Planner 使用 MAVLink 连接到基础电台 COMM 端口，并通过无线电台链路进行通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:75
#: 02d19119076e4ac584ff423041a68e4e 31fa8d3a29ab4c219289a2a94b2dfd11
#: 36d00953b94e4ca1968fb28c6996f03d 4e93dca786b144f49156dede97254592
#: 8825178a99614aa7a3188c4e84bdc45a daad0017a0bb43a7b77d3d3a99bcd4d9
msgid ""
"If you have any problems, be sure that the autopilot's SERIAL port connected"
" to the radio is set to the baud rate (57600 default) and the protocol is "
"MAVLink2 (\"2\")"
msgstr "如果遇到问题，请确保飞控连接电台的串口波特率设置正确（默认 57600），且协议设置为 MAVLink2（'2'）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-v1.rst:72
#: 1ee23ed70b0142088a0bf851c9ed9d03 3ad7f59e9ea3499eb0c9a235ac0ebabb
#: 5bd1f2d0abaa459385d86f1246694621 82304210113648b78d385c1ab7f97c23
#: 84fb56fec5b54bca92f2e16b120596ca
msgid ""
"determine the USB COMM port the base radio is using and enter that into the "
"port selection box of Mission Planner along with the baud rate (57600 is "
"default for the radios)."
msgstr ""
"确定基站电台使用的 USB COMM 端口，将其与波特率一起填入 Mission Planner 的端口选择框（电台默认波特率为 57600）。"
